Scope: this license applies only to the original source code in this
repository — the Obsidian plugin source under `.obsidian/plugins/*/src`
(and their build configs), the pipeline scripts under `.pipeline/scripts/`
and `.pipeline/rag/`, and the tooling under `scripts/`.

It does NOT apply to the manual content shipped alongside this code: the
scanned pages, transcriptions, and derived notes in the numbered section
folders, `Glossar*.md`, `Sicherheitshinweise.md`, `Sonderwerkzeuge.md`,
`Technische-Daten.md`, `Startseite.md`, `LIESMICH.md`, `Referenzbilder/`,
and the source scan folders (`1990 BMW M3 Elektrik-Fehlersuche-Handbuch`,
`BMW N 600 02.0 - Anzugsdrehmomente`, `Bosch Motronic ML 3.1 (Zusatz)`,
`.pipeline/_quellen/`). That content is derived from copyrighted BMW factory
manuals and remains all rights reserved by the original manuals' copyright
holder; no license is granted to it here.

Separately, `.obsidian/plugins/vault-search`'s German synonym data is derived
in part from OpenThesaurus (Daniel Naber et al.), licensed under CC-BY-SA 4.0 /
LGPL 2.1 — see LIESMICH.md and
`.obsidian/plugins/vault-search/scripts/openthesaurus-LICENSE.txt`.
